ues/151","id":2836183804,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLx9Arc6pDLr8","user":{"login":"emadaghajanzadeh","id":45314641,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MzE0NjQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45314641?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emadaghajanzadeh","html_url":"https://github.com/emadaghajanzadeh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emadaghajanzadeh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emadaghajanzadeh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emadaghajanzadeh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emadaghajanzadeh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emadaghajanzadeh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emadaghajanzadeh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emadaghajanzadeh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emadaghajanzadeh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emadaghajanzadeh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T18:48:29Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T18:50:45Z","body":"Hi @zhiwei-pg,\n\nI faced a similar issue when starting CARLA inside a Docker container (Nvidia-cuda image).  \nMy hypothesis is that some utilities from the local machine — such as drivers and their interfaces — are not fully accessible from within the container. These might be essential for the Unreal Engine to properly run CARLA.\n\n**My solution** was to open a dedicated terminal on my host machine (outside the container) and launch CARLA from there. Meanwhile, inside the container, my model (e.g., UniAD) interacted with CARLA over the specified port.  \nTo enable this, I had to go through the code and comment out the part where CARLA was launched from within the code.\n\nAdditionally, for this setup to work, you need to install `vulkan-tools` and `libgeos-dev` on your local machine (outside the container), as pointed out [here](https://github.com/Thinklab-SJTU/Bench2Drive/blob/21d85eebcc219e058eaed02c95ce9d694b4a9175/tools/check_carla.md?plain=1#L27).\n\nNevertheless, finding a way to run CARLA fully inside the container would definitely be a cleaner solution as you do not need to install some stuff on the local machine.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Thinklab-SJTU/Bench2Drive/issues/comments/2836183804/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Thinklab-SJTU/Bench2Drive/issues/comments/2970074301","html_url":"https://github.com/Thinklab-SJTU/Bench2Drive/issues/151#issuecomment-2970074301","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Thinklab-SJTU/Bench2Drive/issues/151","id":2970074301,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLx9Arc6xB7y9","user":{"login":"zhiwei-pg","id":56514953,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NTE0OTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56514953?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhiwei-pg","html_url":"https://github.com/zhiwei-pg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhiwei-pg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhiwei-pg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhiwei-pg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhiwei-pg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhiwei-pg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhiwei-pg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhiwei-pg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhiwei-pg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhiwei-pg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T11:25:17Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T11:25:17Z","body":"Hi @emadaghajanzadeh, thank you so much for your useful advice!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Thinklab-SJTU/Bench2Drive/issues/comments/2970074301/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Thinklab-SJTU/Bench2Drive/issues/comments/3663887996","html_url":"https://github.com/Thinklab-SJTU/Bench2Drive/issues/151#issuecomment-3663887996","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Thinklab-SJTU/Bench2Drive/issues/151","id":3663887996,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLx9Arc7aYn58","user":{"login":"zhoujiawei3","id":144128162,"node_id":"U_kgDOCJc4og","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144128162?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhoujiawei3","html_url":"https://github.com/zhoujiawei3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhoujiawei3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhoujiawei3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhoujiawei3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhoujiawei3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhoujiawei3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhoujiawei3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhoujiawei3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhoujiawei3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhoujiawei3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-17T06:41:32Z","updated_at":"2025-12-17T06:41:32Z","body":"Same issue, but I want to run it on a cloud server. I’m encountering the same problem when starting CARLA, and since it’s running on a cloud server, I can’t control or interact with anything outside the container/image on the host side. Is there any way to fix this?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reac